      "details": {
        "pass": true,
        "fight": {
          "text": "FightWith a sword, press Swing for a light swing. Keep holding through that swing and its recovery to start charging, then release Swing for a heavy. A heavy normally takes one heart, flings knights further and breaks guard; fill the charge arc for extra reach. With a pickup weapon, Swing fires it. Block stops swords and bounces arrows back; block just as they swing to parry and stun them. Holding block drains your guard. Swing while blocking to shield-bash. Dash hops pits and dodges; attack right after a dash for a stab. Knights get flung further the more hurt they are. Three hearts and you're out for a couple of seconds.",
