          "text": "Solo keyboard: Move: W / Up arrow, A / Left arrow, S / Down arrow, D / Right arrow · Swing: Space / J / F · Dash: Left Shift / Right Shift / K / G · Block: E / L / H. Mouse aims, left click swings or fires, right click blocks. Keyboard half 1: Move: W, A, S, D · Swing: F · Dash: G · Block: H. Keyboard half 2: Move: Up arrow, Left arrow, Down arrow, Right arrow · Swing: J · Dash: K · Block: L. Sword: press Swing for a light swing; keep holding through its recovery to charge, then release for a heavy. Pickup weapons: Swing fires. Shout 1-4 / 7-0. Escape / P opens the match menu.",
